<title>UK: British Biotech names finance director.</title>
<headline>British Biotech names finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Biotech Plc said on Wednesday it had appointed Malcolm Fallen as group finance director.</p>
<p>Fallen, who replaces James Noble who left unexpectedly earlier this year, was formerly finance director of the personal communications division of British Telecommunications Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
